cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use nanoMMO in your work, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "nanoMMO: Building an MMO, the engineering series"
abstract: >-
  The game built in the YouTube series Building an MMO: The Engineering Series:
  a C++ server, a C++ client drawn with raylib, and everything around them,
  from MySQL and Redis storage and a protobuf protocol over TLS to Prometheus
  monitoring. Each episode's code is a git tag in the repository.
authors:
  - given-names: Adrian Mircea
    family-names: Nenu
repository-code: "https://github.com/nenuadrian/nanoMMO"
url: "https://nanommo.nenuadrian.com"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - MMORPG
  - game server
  - game engine
  - networking
  - observability
  - C++
